{"ID":"20240314094835-1k87r6f","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314094835-1k87r6f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314094835-1k87r6f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171714-spzvj6f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171714-m2fvp7y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171714-m2fvp7y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:23,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:23\u0026#125;","title":"【蛇床子散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171714"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171714-spzvj6f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171714-spzvj6f","updated":"20240422171714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人隂寒，温隂中，坐药，蛇床子散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171714-baybypy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171714-baybypy","updated":"20240422171714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蛇床子散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171714-h25jfuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171714-h25jfuz","updated":"20240422171714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"蛇床子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171714-dq6j25v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171714-dq6j25v","updated":"20240422171714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右一味，末之，以白粉少许，和合相得，如枣大，緜里内之，自然温。当云不痒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171714-chsrovj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171714-chsrovj","updated":"20240422171714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人阴寒，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那老师什么是阴寒啊？阴寒就是阴痒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不给你解释这个痒，你不知道这个寒是痒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"太太阴部很痒，阴道里面很痒啊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！里面可能有寄生虫或者是湿很盛在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171714-epjhjn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171714-epjhjn9","updated":"20240422171714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚刚用的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"矾石丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也是塞到阴部去，但是那是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"带下很厚重、严重的带下时用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个呢是阴部很痒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你们没有碰到过这种病人啊！那个病人跟我讲，太太跟我讲她说真的不好意思，很痒啊，我走到沃尔玛突然痒起来了，抓又不好意思，那么多人在那边怎么抓，对不对？很难过！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"温阴中，坐药，蛇床子散主之"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个药呢，一剂就知"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171714-jinkwdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171714-jinkwdz","updated":"20240422171714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你把这个药打成粉末，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白粉你不要去用哦，不要真的去用白粉啊！白粉是真的是有寄生虫在里面的时候我们会用到白粉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。上堂课我给诸位介绍过，如何取白粉，盆盖住，烧里面杯中的水银，盆里面的顶上面产生的粉末就是白粉，这是专门打虫的。如果你用蛇床子粉，我们一般"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用棉布袋包起来，然后塞到阴部去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"速度快到什么程度，塞进去就停了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果塞进去还痒还很严重还没好，那就是要你去加白粉了，了解我的意思吧？所以你不要随便去做白粉，一般来说我蛇床子粉一剂就够了，当场就会好。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171714-p47zo34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171714-p47zo34","updated":"20240422171714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你给他说现在呢，我们美国很多那个药房里面都有卖的，那种女孩子阴道的月经条。我们就让病人呢用月经条粘粘那个蛇床子粉，放在阴部去都可以，效果非常得快。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171714-3ysqqsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171714-3ysqqsm","updated":"20240422171714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你们刚刚看到的蛇床子粉外用法，老师这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"内服可不可以，也可以"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们常常开处方的时候，比如这个太太还有其他问题，比如说她是少阳证，往来寒热。正好月经来了，我们怕他如见神灵，看鬼了。我们用小柴胡汤在里面，小柴胡汤...（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"模仿病人语气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）医生你等一下哦，你等一下开药，我还有阴痒。那你小柴胡汤里面可以加个两钱的蛇床子，外面给她一点蛇床子粉，就可以了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171714-m2fvp7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171714-m2fvp7y","updated":"20240422171714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以不是说那个处方外用就完了，内服也可以用的。"}]}]}